{
  "name": "LuLu - daily campaign sender",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LuLu daily campaign sender\nSends today's LIVE campaign messages ONE at a time with growing gaps: 60 s, 61 s, 62 s \u2026 (set in the app: Campaigns \u2192 Step 3).\n\n**Setup**\n1. Supabase: migrations up to 053.\n2. WACRM: API key with scopes `messages:send` (and `contacts:write` if you reuse it for the sync).\n3. n8n: *Header Auth* credential `Authorization: Bearer <key>` on all three HTTP nodes.\n4. In the app: campaign Live switch **On** + **Make LIVE**.\n\n**Safety (enforced by the app, not n8n):** daily cap, no sends 22:00-09:00 Riyadh, STOP list, data < 36 h old, auto-pause on Meta rate-limit/block errors or 5 failures in a row. Calling send-next too early is refused.\n\nRun **Manual** once and watch Campaigns \u2192 Step 3 \u2192 Today. Activate the workflow for the daily 17:00 run (100 msgs \u2248 3 h).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        -300
      ],
      "id": "lulu-sender-0"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Manual run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ],
      "id": "lulu-sender-1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 17
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Daily 17:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        340
      ],
      "id": "lulu-sender-2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://jwacrm.vercel.app/api/v1/lulu/campaigns/prepare",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({}) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "name": "Prepare today's queue",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        250
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "id": "lulu-sender-3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "q",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.queued }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Anything queued?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        520,
        250
      ],
      "id": "lulu-sender-4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ $json.first_wait_seconds || 60 }}",
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "name": "Wait first gap",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        780,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "lulu-sender-wait-first",
      "id": "lulu-sender-5"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://jwacrm.vercel.app/api/v1/lulu/campaigns/send-next",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({}) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "name": "Send next message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "id": "lulu-sender-6"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.done }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "e",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.error }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "object",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Finished?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1300,
        200
      ],
      "id": "lulu-sender-7"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ $json.next_wait_seconds || 60 }}",
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "name": "Wait next gap",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1300,
        420
      ],
      "webhookId": "lulu-sender-wait-next",
      "id": "lulu-sender-8"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Done for today",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1560,
        180
      ],
      "id": "lulu-sender-9"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Nothing to send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        780,
        400
      ],
      "id": "lulu-sender-10"
    }
  ],
